From 557f394d7e7d33ef6f023a904ccb786e43cab7fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 12:50:51 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/8] feat(repos): create_branch from_sha; safer delete_file
 and push_files; reject no-op issue updates

create_branch accepts from_sha to start a branch at a commit.
delete_file refuses directory paths and missing files, and takes an
optional sha precondition. push_files no longer creates a missing
branch unless create_branch is true, and creates it only once the
commit exists so a failure leaves no branch behind. issue_write update
fails when it would change nothing.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
